sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Web as 官网 /pricing
    participant API as 后端 API
    participant StripeSvc as StripeService
    participant Stripe as Stripe API
    participant Webhook as Webhook Handler
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    rect rgb(20, 20, 40)
        Note over User, DB: 支付发起流程
        User->>Web: 点击"月付$3"按钮
        Web->>API: POST /api/membership/checkout { planType: "MONTHLY" }
        API->>API: authenticate 中间件验证 JWT
        API->>DB: 查询用户是否已有 Membership
        alt 已有 ACTIVE 会员
            API-->>Web: { code: 400, message: '您已有有效会员' }
        else 无会员或已过期
            API->>StripeSvc: createSubscriptionCheckout()
            alt 无 stripeCustomerId
                StripeSvc->>Stripe: 创建 Customer
                Stripe-->>StripeSvc: customerId
            end
            StripeSvc->>Stripe: 创建 Checkout Session
            Stripe-->>StripeSvc: { url }
            API-->>Web: { data: { url } }
            Web->>User: 重定向到 Stripe Checkout
        end
    end

    rect rgb(20, 40, 20)
        Note over User, DB: 支付完成流程
        User->>Stripe: 在 Stripe 页面完成支付
        Stripe->>User: 重定向回 /account?payment=success
        par 并行
            Stripe->>Webhook: POST /api/stripe/webhook (checkout.session.completed)
            Webhook->>Webhook: 验证签名
            Webhook->>DB: 创建/更新 Membership { status: ACTIVE }
            Webhook-->>Stripe: 200 OK
        and
            Web->>API: GET /api/membership
            API-->>Web: { isMember: true }
            Web->>User: 显示会员状态
        end
    end
